OL,3,GNEWSABurnham invites Swinney to work
OL,4,Atogether on 'deeper Scottish
OL,5,Adevolution'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe prime minister has invited the
OL,8,FScottish government to work with the UK
OL,9,Fgovernment to put "power back in the
OL,10,Fhands" of regions.
OL,12,FAndy Burnham said he wanted the two
OL,13,Fgovernments to start work on a new deal
OL,14,Ffor regional economic development in
OL,15,Fthe next few months.
OL,17,FSpeaking at an event in North
OL,18,FLanarkshire, Burnham said Scotland
OL,19,Fremained "one of the most centralised
OL,20,Fnations in Europe" and called for
OL,21,Ffurther powers to be devolved to local
OL,22,Fareas from Holyrood.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
