OL,3,GNEWSABurnham invites Swinney to work
OL,4,Atogether on 'deeper Scottish
OL,5,Adevolution'
OL,6,
OL,7,FSwinney told a media huddle at the SNP
OL,8,Fconference in Aberdeen he was
OL,9,Finterested in "working constructively"
OL,10,Fwith Westminster, adding he was "all
OL,11,Ffor the Scottish Parliament having as
OL,12,Fmany powers" as possible.
